---
layout: base.njk
section: home
permalink: /
extraStyles:
  - landing-journey.css
---

{#- ============================================================
   Homepage: the scroll-driven journey from Sputnik to JWST.
   "On this day" appears between hero and journey when there is a match.
   ============================================================ -#}

<section class="journey-hero">
  <p class="hero-kicker">A connected encyclopedia</p>
  <h1>Humanity's journey<br>into space</h1>
  <p class="hook">
    It began with a beep in 1957. {{ missions | length }} missions later, a
    golden mirror in deep space is photographing the oldest galaxies we can
    see. Follow the record, launch by launch.
  </p>
  <div class="hero-actions">
    <a class="btn btn-solid" href="/catalog/">Explore all missions</a>
    <a class="btn" href="#on-this-day" id="otd-link">On this day ↓</a>
  </div>
  <p class="hero-credit">Carina Nebula · NASA, ESA, CSA, STScI</p>
  <dl class="facts-strip" aria-label="Dataset statistics">
    <div><dt>Missions</dt><dd>{{ missions | length }}</dd></div>
    <div><dt>Eras</dt><dd>6</dd></div>
    <div><dt>Countries &amp; entities</dt><dd>{{ countries | length }}</dd></div>
    <div><dt>Years covered</dt><dd>{{ (missions | last).year - (missions | first).year + 1 }}</dd></div>
  </dl>
</section>

{% set otd = missions | onThisDay %}
{% set otdWeek = missions | nearestAnniversaries %}
<section class="otd reveal" id="on-this-day">
  {% if otd and otd.length > 0 %}
  <h2 class="section-title">On this day in space history</h2>
  <div class="card-grid">
    {% for m in otd %}
      {% include "partials/mission-card.njk" %}
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
  {% elif otdWeek.length > 0 %}
  <h2 class="section-title">Around this date in space history</h2>
  <p class="otd-note">No landmark launch on today's exact date. These are
     the launch anniversaries closest to it.</p>
  <div class="card-grid">
    {% for m in otdWeek %}
      {% include "partials/mission-card.njk" %}
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
  {% else %}
  <h2 class="section-title">On this day in space history</h2>
  <p class="otd-empty mono-tag">
    No launches recorded on today's date. Browse the full catalog instead.
  </p>
  {% endif %}
</section>

<section class="evo-strip">
  {% set span = (missions | sortByYear | last).year - (missions | first).year + 1 %}
  <h2 class="section-title reveal">{{ span }} years. One journey.</h2>
  <p class="evo-lede reveal">
    Every spacecraft below descends from an earlier one. The beep led to
    Laika, Laika to Gagarin, Gagarin to the Moon. Two machines kept going
    and have now left the Solar System. The newest, a gold mirror,
    photographs the first galaxies. Nine milestones tell the story.
  </p>
  <ol class="evolution" id="evolution" aria-label="Milestone missions, 1957 to today">
    {% set highlightIds = ['sputnik-1-1957', 'sputnik-2-1957', 'vostok-1-1961', 'apollo-11-1969', 'pioneer-10-1972', 'voyager-1-2-1977', 'hubble-space-telescope-1990', 'zarya-international-space-station-assembly-begins-1998', 'james-webb-space-telescope-2021'] %}
    {% for hid in highlightIds %}
      {% set m = missions | missionById(hid) %}
      {% if m %}
    <li class="evo-item reveal" style="--era-accent: {{ m.era | eraAccent }}">
      <a href="/missions/{{ m.id }}/">
        <span class="evo-node" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span class="evo-year">{{ m.year }}</span>
        {% if m.media %}<span class="evo-media"><img src="/{{ m.media.thumb }}" alt="{{ m.name }}" loading="lazy"></span>{% endif %}
        <span class="evo-name">{{ m.name }}</span>
        <span class="evo-outcome">{{ m.outcome }}</span>
      </a>
    </li>
      {% endif %}
    {% endfor %}
  </ol>
  <div class="reveal center-cta">
    {% set firstMission = missions | sortByYear | first %}
    <a class="btn btn-solid" href="/missions/{{ firstMission.id }}/">Begin in 1957</a>
  </div>
</section>

<script type="module" src="/scripts/home.js"></script>
